ficiency and associated health issues.,1\r\n3492,GRAAT JM,\"Graat JM is a researcher who analyzed the effects of vitamin E on infections, finding paradoxical results in a study published in JAMA 2002.\",1\r\n3498,NEUROPATÍA ATÁXICA,\"Ataxic neuropathy is a condition that can result from severe vitamin E deficiency, leading to coordination problems.\",1\r\n12128,PREBIOTICS,\"Prebiotics are non-digestible food components that play a crucial role in promoting the growth of beneficial microorganisms in the intestines. They are known to stimulate the growth of beneficial bacteria in the gut, which can potentially aid in the management of various gastrointestinal issues, including diarrhea and inflammatory bowel disease. By fostering a healthy gut microbiome, prebiotics contribute to overall digestive health and may offer therapeutic benefits for individuals suffering from these conditions.\",2\r\n1865,SÍNDROMES DE MALABSORCIÓN,\"Malabsorption syndromes are conditions that hinder the absorption of nutrients from food, which can lead to deficiencies in essential vitamins, including vitamin E. These syndromes often necessitate enteral nutrition to ensure that individuals receive adequate nutrients despite their impaired absorption capabilities.\",1\r\n13262,COBALAMINA (B12),\"La cobalamina, o vitamina B12, es esencial para la mielinización, un proceso crítico para la función neuronal.\",1\r\n13263,PIRIDOXINA (B6),\"La piridoxina, o vitamina B6, es importante para la síntesis de reguladores bioquímicos que afectan la función cerebral.\",1\r\n13264,ÁCIDO FÓLICO (B9),\"El ácido fólico, o vitamina B9, es crucial para el desarrollo fetal del sistema nervioso central.\",1\r\n12369,B12,Vitamin B12 is a vitamin that may be supplemented in high doses for patients with moderate deficiencies.,1\r\n12386,SYMBIOTICS,Symbiotics are combinations of probiotics and prebiotics that may enhance the health benefits of both.,1\r\n7297,BETA-CAROTENOS,\"Los beta-carotenos son compuestos que se encuentran en frutas y verduras de color naranja y verde, y se asocian con beneficios para la salud, incluyendo la reducción del riesgo de enfermedades crónicas.\",1\r\n7295,ENFERMEDAD CEREBROVASCULAR,\"Enfermedad cerebrovascular se refiere a un grupo de condiciones que afectan el flujo sanguíneo al cerebro, lo que puede resultar en un accidente cerebrovascular o ictus.\",1\r\n7823,AGCML N-3,AGCML n-3 refers to high supplements of omega-3 fatty acids that may increase lipid peroxidation and reduce cytokine production.,1\r\n7825,INGESTA DE TOCOFEROL,\"Tocopherol intake is related to the dietary consumption of vitamin E, which can influence lipid peroxidation.\",1\r\n\n\n-----Relationships-----\nhuman_readable_id,source,target,description,combined_degree\r\n4715,NUTRICIÓN PARENTERAL,VITAMINA E,Vitamin E is included in parenteral nutrition to protect cells from oxidative stress,466\r\n2719,NUTRICIÓN ENTERAL,VITAMINA C,Vitamin C levels must be monitored in patients receiving enteral nutrition to avoid toxicity,369\r\n8441,VITAMINA E,NUTRICIÓN PEDIÁTRICA,Vitamina E is included in pediatric nutrition for its antioxidant properties,190\r\n1905,ENFERMEDAD DE ALZHEIMER,DIABETES,La diabetes es una condición que puede complicar el tratamiento y manejo de pacientes con enfermedad de Alzheimer,179\r\n270,DISFAGIA,ENFERMEDAD DE ALZHEIMER,Alzheimer's disease is associated with a high prevalence of dysphagia among patients,169\r\n5814,OBESIDAD,ENFERMEDAD CORONARIA,Obesity is a significant risk factor for the development of coronary heart disease,131\r\n5846,OBESIDAD,CÁNCER DE COLON,Obesity is associated with an increased risk of colon cancer,129\r\n8438,VITAMINA E,OSTEOPOROSIS,\"La vitamina E puede tener un papel en la salud ósea, y su deficiencia puede contribuir a la osteoporosis.\",111\r\n8420,VITAMINA D,VITAMINA C,Both vitamins are essential for maintaining health and are often included in health supplements,108\r\n7062,FIBROSIS QUÍSTICA,VITAMINA E,\"Patients with cystic fibrosis